### Pattern Matching Validation

#### uses case keyword for patterns

- Verify: uses case keyword for patterns


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: uses case keyword for patterns")
fn classify(x: i64) -> text:
    match x:
        case 0:
            "zero"
        case _:
            "other"
expect classify(0) == "zero"
```

</details>

#### uses if for guards

- Verify: uses if for guards


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: uses if for guards")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
fn classify(x: i64) -> text:
    match x:
        case n if n < 0:
            "negative"
        case _:
            "non-negative"
expect classify(-5) == "negative"
```

</details>

